Subject: [PATCH] Initialize the command writer before construction can fail

Tachiai adaptation of OpenConnect 9.21 library.c, 2026-10-09.
The calloc default of zero otherwise causes vpninfo_free to close unrelated
FD 0 before setup_cmd_pipe succeeds. No protocol or cryptographic changes.

--- a/library.c
+++ b/library.c
@@ -198,0 +199,2 @@ struct openconnect_info *openconnect_vpninfo_new(const char *useragent,
+	/* Modified by Tachiai, 2026-10-09: preserve unrelated FD 0 on cleanup. */
+	vpninfo->cmd_fd_write = -1;
